msgid "Power status pins"
msgstr "Piny stavu napájení"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:270
msgid ""
"Three active‑low status inputs let firmware see what the on‑board power "
"management chip is doing:"
msgstr ""
"Tři stavové vstupy aktivní v nule umožňují firmwaru vidět, co dělá čip "
"správy napájení na desce:"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-n6.rst:273
msgid ""
"**ST** — low when the board is running on VIN, high when running on USB "
